  - initialDialog:
    - name: 16
      dialog: Admiral Gideon. Report.
    - name: 3
      dialog: We made it back and we are not alone.
    - name: 16
      dialog: I know. The creature arrived first and is already at work.
    - name: 0
      dialog: She called it a weapon and says it will "silence the void".
    - name: 3
      dialog: She avoids specifics.
    - name: 16
      dialog: The Emperor has given me full authority to defend Earth. I will take
        any weapon I can use.
    - name: 16
      dialog: A Skeran fleet just breached the outer rim.
    - name: 0
      dialog: Yeah... we destroyed their Citadel on the way through.
    - name: 3
      dialog: We'll deal with them.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 0
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 999
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog: []
    autoPilotMapping: 16
    autoPilotDialog:
    - name: 11
      dialog: Did your race ever wonder why the gateways in your home sector converge
        on your planet?
    - name: 0
      dialog: The Architects?
    - name: 11
      dialog: Exactly. The Architects shaped this sector around their home, not yours.
    - name: 11
      dialog: You inherited their world, their technology, and their sins.
    - name: 11
      dialog: I will finish what they started. Hold the sector until the weapon is
        complete.
    inputTutorialStep: 0
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 1000
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
